BODY=Pre-seed FindingDispositionRecords (long-lived with a yesterday periodCounts bucket, recent, and legacy without buckets), trigger the rollup manually (same paths as E2E-41), and confirm windowed numbers come from in-window activity only — 7d surfaced = 4 not 200+, legacy contributes 0, 7d ≤ 30d ≤ 90d — and that new reviews write periodCounts buckets on both backends. No fixture PR.
